---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="/ BRIEF" description="The Second Pass technical briefing.">
  <section class="shell route">
    <header class="route-head">
      <div class="kicker">/ BRIEF</div>
      <h1>The second pass, in one email.</h1>
      <p>
        One consequential development, three technical signals, one useful chart, and one deeper
        read. No newsletter provider is connected yet, so this page intentionally does not collect
        an email address. The format below is what subscribers will receive.
      </p>
    </header>
    <div class="first-pass">
      <h2>PLANNED FORMAT</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>01 / The development that matters most this cycle</li>
        <li>02 / Three signals worth keeping — changes that didn't make the first headline</li>
        <li>03 / One chart or data update from / DATA</li>
        <li>04 / One deeper piece from / SECOND PASS worth the time</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div style="max-width:var(--reading);margin-top:32px;font:1.05rem/1.55 var(--reader);color:var(--graphite)">
      <p>When a provider is selected and connected, the subscription form will appear here. Until then,
      this page documents the product intent.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
